    "description": "**PLACEHOLDER — raised 2026-09-01, field list to be confirmed.**\n\n## Requirement\n\nThe existing all-assignments (internal/admin) list view on Deal Rep Assignment shows too little to be useful. Add the key fields so the view is workable without opening each record.\n\n## Proposed solution (draft)\n\nCandidate columns — to be confirmed with the team:\n\n* Assignment name / number\n* Deal (and Operator + Partner, via formula or lookup fields if not already on DRA)\n* Brand Ambassador / rep\n* Status\n* Market / country\n* Affiliate link (or link count)\n* Sign-Up count\n* Start / end or effective dates\n* Created date, Last modified\n\nAny column that is not a field on DRA today needs either a formula field or a cross-object reference added first — list views cannot traverse relationships beyond what is on the object.\n\n## Open questions\n\n* Confirm the final column list and order.\n* Which fields need to be created on DRA to support it (e.g. Operator, Partner, Sign-Up count)?\n* Default sort and filter for the view — all records, or active assignments only?\n* Sharing: does this view stay admin/internal only, or is it also visible to managers?\n\n",
